+/// Atomic session snapshot watermark and retained frames after its durable base.
+///
+/// Initial reduction precedence is normative:
+/// 1. hydrate canonical `session` from the enclosing `SessionResponse`;
+/// 2. treat this top-level aligned checkpoint as the durable base (inline may
+///    replace normalized transcript/tool content; refetch is already satisfied
+///    by this same fresh GET);
+/// 3. reduce `pending_events` exactly once in cursor order for transcript/tool/
+///    checkpoint content, where inline checkpoint replaces content and a refetch
+///    checkpoint aborts attach and starts a new GET;
+/// 4. install every field in `state` as an authoritative replacement, never as
