   323	        // periods, so debug — not warn. Per-subscriber *lag* (a slow client that
   324	        // overflows the ring buffer) surfaces on the RECEIVE side as
   325	        // `Lagged(n)`, which the SSE handlers log at warn (OCEAN-87).
