 478	/// Atomic session snapshot watermark and retained frames after its durable base.
 479	///
 480	/// Initial reduction precedence is normative:
 481	/// 1. hydrate canonical `session` from the enclosing `SessionResponse`;
 482	/// 2. treat this top-level aligned checkpoint as the durable base (inline may
 483	///    replace normalized transcript/tool content; refetch is already satisfied
 484	///    by this same fresh GET);
 485	/// 3. reduce `pending_events` exactly once in cursor order for transcript/tool/
 486	///    checkpoint content, where inline checkpoint replaces content and a refetch
 487	///    checkpoint aborts attach and starts a new GET;
 488	/// 4. install every field in `state` as an authoritative replacement, never as
 489	///    additional reducer events;
